ntdll: Probe the <probing privatePath> of a module's configuration file for private assemblies.
Reads <module>.config (manifest resource 1) or <module>.<id>.config when building the
module's activation context and looks in <appdir>\<dir>\ and <appdir>\<dir>\<name>\ after the
usual places. After Effects' Mocha AE plug-in loads its Qt6 DLLs this way.

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/actctx.c b/dlls/ntdll/actctx.c
